  "problems": "Inches tables also published. Woman Bottoms inches table lists Inseam 44 in for 44/XXL while the cm table says 86 cm (about 34 in), so the inch value looks like a typo on the site; cm values recorded. Denim waist aliases are published as ranges (e.g. \"27 - 28\") and 28 appears in both S and M. Tops 30 and 32 are both labelled XXS. A separate \"Woman Tops (oversized)\" body chart (range sizes 32-34/XXS/XS etc.) exists and is not recorded."
